WEBVTT

00:18:54.178 --> 00:19:01.163
(Applause)

00:19:01.593 --> 00:19:02.743
What?

00:19:02.767 --> 00:19:05.250
(Applause)

00:19:06.219 --> 00:19:08.062
But in all seriousness,

00:19:08.086 --> 00:19:11.609
because this idea is birthed in TED,

00:19:11.633 --> 00:19:16.976
I would like it to be
a legacy of TED, and I'd like to call it

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:22.221
the "International System for Total
Early Disease Detection."

00:19:22.245 --> 00:19:23.443
[INSTEDD]

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:30.386
And INSTEDD then becomes our mantra.